RECOMMENDATION:  Staff recommends approval of the annexation application for Braden Homesites,
with the following conditions:
1) Please include that portion of Gysel Place adjacent to the project in the annexation boundary.
2) Rename the title block on the annexation map to "Braden Homesites", neither a preliminary map
or recorded map for "Braden Homesites, 2nd Filing" exists.
3) City Ground Datum coordinates need to be provided for the two corners of one boundary course
(including the SW corner of this proposed annexation).
4) In NOTE 3 a found 1/2” IP was disturbed and replaced. Define which monument was replaced.
