(FYI) There is water and sewer available to serve this development off Dell Range Blvd.
The developer will be required to construct a looped water main system to serve this
development. Owner/Developer is responsible for verifying the available sewer capacity
of the existing sewer system in the area to serve this project.
o
(FYI) The property Owner/Developer shall be required to extend the water and sanitary
sewer utilities from their current location to the farthest point (or points) of the property
being developed. These utility extensions shall be to a point (or points) that are logical
for projected future connections to future development projects, as determined by the
BOPU and the property owner/developer. The Board of Public Utilities prefers all water
and sewer main extensions to remain in the City’s right of way when all possible.
